{"case_id": "VT-S09", "question": "从CaiT与T2T-ViT的设计中，总结深度、宽度和优化之间应如何共同考虑。", "category": "synthesis", "split": "dev", "reference_answer": "增加深度不自动带来收益。CaiT用残差缩放改善深网络优化；T2T通过实测选择更深更窄骨干以提高有限计算预算效率。应同时考虑训练稳定性和容量配置。", "relevant_sources": [{"document_id": "cait", "page": 3, "quote": "stability"}, {"document_id": "t2t", "page": 2, "quote": "deep-narrow"}], "expected_tools": ["knowledge_qa", "summarize_paper"], "reviewed": true, "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true, "inference_basis": "paper_statement", "source_provenance": [{"paper_key": "cait", "physical_page": 3, "pdf_sha256": "1b19d6662fa46bfaa45d180ae48d24b60b4ab201e0e056f5cc8b09074937f202", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2103.17239v2", "page_text_sha256": "cd873f4030745e64286e58e90a341bb808d554fb939c53e91acb367c2079f9f8", "check": "Full source page read; short literal anchor verified; answer paraphrased", "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true}, {"paper_key": "t2t", "physical_page": 2, "pdf_sha256": "66163ef50be6ec80518cd8acfff3444b39a6d1a3461c1dea3974ff3408193dc6", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2101.11986v3", "page_text_sha256": "09e0cdc51fbf3946ac3f1b657c4f758ed40efcb1045a432c44541fcd0e298c8d", "check": "Full source page read; short literal anchor verified; answer paraphrased", "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true}], "annotation_note": "AI原文核对；尚待学生/教师人工复核。document_id为稳定paper_key，导入后必须映射实际ID。"}
{"case_id": "VT-S14", "question": "结合BEiT与CaiT，为什么讨论扩展模型规模时不能只报告层数或参数变大？", "category": "synthesis", "split": "dev", "reference_answer": "BEiT讨论预训练目标和数据能否支撑大模型；CaiT展示深度增加还受优化稳定性限制。规模收益依赖学习信号、数据与优化条件，需要相应对照实验。", "relevant_sources": [{"document_id": "beit", "page": 6, "quote": "large size"}, {"document_id": "cait", "page": 3, "quote": "stability"}], "expected_tools": ["knowledge_qa", "summarize_paper"], "reviewed": true, "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true, "inference_basis": "paper_statement", "source_provenance": [{"paper_key": "beit", "physical_page": 6, "pdf_sha256": "6455f47a0ad99294c9e1eb8a361da558f87f9e4446f5d6c0b02c20646a93741c", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2106.08254v2", "page_text_sha256": "07a24a7ea3839f900390f504eb0fc8580d389be258d836508871229e7114dc1c", "check": "Full source page read; short literal anchor verified; answer paraphrased", "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true}, {"paper_key": "cait", "physical_page": 3, "pdf_sha256": "1b19d6662fa46bfaa45d180ae48d24b60b4ab201e0e056f5cc8b09074937f202", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2103.17239v2", "page_text_sha256": "cd873f4030745e64286e58e90a341bb808d554fb939c53e91acb367c2079f9f8", "check": "Full source page read; short literal anchor verified; answer paraphrased", "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true}], "annotation_note": "AI原文核对；尚待学生/教师人工复核。document_id为稳定paper_key，导入后必须映射实际ID。"}
{"case_id": "VT-R01", "question": "按ViT的patch划分公式，224×224图像与16×16 patch产生多少个patch token？加入class token后序列长多少？", "category": "reasoning", "split": "dev", "reference_answer": "224/16=14；patch数14×14=196，加入一个class token后为197。这是公式计算，不是论文单独测量的实验指标。", "relevant_sources": [{"document_id": "vit", "page": 3, "quote": "HW/P"}], "expected_tools": ["knowledge_qa", "calculator"], "reviewed": true, "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true, "inference_basis": "calculation_from_reported_values", "source_provenance": [{"paper_key": "vit", "physical_page": 3, "pdf_sha256": "8ce7b83971a14508ca711a27c875c9b6914c4f6767cf3150fb1ca6c07aa056d6", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2010.11929v2", "page_text_sha256": "5f9d529f1fee3dfec27bf12163a5be7b3a767e0dbe701bf553ace9ea8b50d419", "check": "Full source page read; short literal anchor verified; answer paraphrased", "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true}], "annotation_note": "AI原文核对；尚待学生/教师人工复核。document_id为稳定paper_key，导入后必须映射实际ID。"}
{"case_id": "VT-R04", "question": "T2T-ViT表2中ViT-S/16为78.1%、48.6M，T2T-ViT-14为81.5%、21.5M。准确率增加多少个百分点，参数减少比例是多少？", "category": "reasoning", "split": "dev", "reference_answer": "准确率增加81.5-78.1=3.4个百分点；参数减少(48.6-21.5)/48.6≈55.76%。这些是表中该组从头训练ImageNet配置的比较。", "relevant_sources": [{"document_id": "t2t", "page": 6, "quote": "78.1"}], "expected_tools": ["knowledge_qa", "calculator"], "reviewed": true, "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true, "inference_basis": "calculation_from_reported_values", "source_provenance": [{"paper_key": "t2t", "physical_page": 6, "pdf_sha256": "66163ef50be6ec80518cd8acfff3444b39a6d1a3461c1dea3974ff3408193dc6", "pdf_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2101.11986v3", "page_text_sha256": "f23944c168e96808735d7d144a962c79f76b7ae3fbd4c4f8f7379a88be7e9405", "check": "Full source page read; short literal anchor verified; answer paraphrased", "review_method": "assistant_source_checked", "human_review_pending": true}], "annotation_note": "AI原文核对；尚待学生/教师人工复核。document_id为稳定paper_key，导入后必须映射实际ID。"}
